    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:ec46e3209ab74818",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "4ac84797ceec2e4f02af9ee65572bad2df24a73df9d54f9252c7d011d0d73473",
      "text": "A day devoted to two of Bonito’s most iconic natural attractions. Begin with the magnificent Gruta do Lago Azul (Blue Lake Cave), where a deep sapphire-blue lake creates one of Brazil’s most photographed natural wonders. Then continue to the São Miguel Cave, an impressive limestone cavern with fascinating rock formations developed over millions of years, where elevated walkways offer exceptional views while protecting this fragile environment.\n\nIn the afternoon, an unforgettable floating adventure along the crystal-clear Rio Sucuri: equipped with snorkelling gear, drift gently downstream as colourful fish swim beneath you and the exceptional clarity of the water reveals a fascinating underwater world. A relaxing activity that shows why Bonito is recognised internationally as a model of responsible ecotourism.\n\nIncluded: Gruta do Lago Azul · São Miguel Cave · Rio Sucuri floating with snorkelling gear (English-speaking guide)",
